== toggle_grid n_doors=1: 25 starts (room 0, doors closed), K <= 80
   V1 (positions, <=k, doors in): Betti values seen = [(1, 0)]; starts with any change = 0
   V2 (exactly k): topology changes per start, median 0 (min 0, max 6); first change at k = [None, 1]
   V3 (full state, layers): k* == model-BFS steps to first switch entry for every start: True
   V4 (positions, door cells left out): k* == model-BFS steps to first cell of room 1 for every start: True
   V3: Spearman(k*, true BFS steps to door) = 1.000; Spearman(k*, model-BFS steps to door) = 1.000; k* - model door steps in [-5]
   V4: Spearman(k*, true BFS steps to door) = 1.000; Spearman(k*, model-BFS steps to door) = 1.000; k* - model door steps in [1]

