== loop maze (door at (6, 3), second opening at (6, 1)); free space Betti = (1, 1)
   k* (b1: 0 -> 1) == max BFS distance over the obstacle's 4 neighbours, every start: True
   Spearman(k*, BFS steps to door) = 0.882; to second opening = 0.864; to min(door, opening) = 1.000; to max(door, opening) = 0.891
